<title>USA: Dynamic Materials Corp Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>Dynamic Materials Corp Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>LAFAYETTE, Colo. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>FOR THE QUARTERS ENDED MARCH 31, 1997 AND 1996</p>
<p>							 1997	   1996</p>
<p> NET SALES				   $9,781,910    $5,995,574</p>
<p> NET INCOME				     625,258	 250,295</p>
<p> NET INCOME PER SHARE			     .22	     .09</p>
<p>WEIGHTED AVERAGE NUMBER OF SHARES</p>
<p>  OUTSTANDING				 2,891,140     2,641,743</p>
<p>NOTE:  Increased net income was due, in part, to the July, 1996 acquisition of the Detaclad business of DuPont Co and the timing of shipments from two large orders booked with an Australian fabricator in 1996.</p>
<p>Revenues in the first quarter included $3.2 million in non-recurring shipments from the large Australian orders.</p>
</text>
